  "overview": "Gekitotsu Koushien is a super deep high school baseball tournament simulator. Like the Little League World Series, in Japan Koshien is a huge tournament. With over 4000 teams involved (and all of that data put into this game!) it is a great place for scouts to find professional players, and the game is a great and totally unique baseball experience."
